{"file": "天降萌娃，奶爸开店致富-第156集.mp4", "ep": 156, "duration": 42.1, "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 0.8, "text": "兄弟"}, {"start": 0.8, "end": 1.8, "text": "当我不存在"}, {"start": 2.79, "end": 7.27, "text": "你敢动我"}, {"start": 7.27, "end": 8.87, "text": "知道我背后是谁吗"}, {"start": 8.87, "end": 9.79, "text": "杨野"}, {"start": 9.79, "end": 12.85, "text": "江城最大的二手车市场都是他的"}, {"start": 12.85, "end": 14.11, "text": "杨野"}, {"start": 14.11, "end": 15.07, "text": "怕了"}, {"start": 15.07, "end": 17.94, "text": "我贷款公司也有杨野股份"}, {"start": 17.94, "end": 19.3, "text": "你说的杨野"}, {"start": 19.3, "end": 20.54, "text": "是不是王德洋"}, {"start": 20.54, "end": 25.07, "text": "对"}, {"start": 25.07, "end": 26.11, "text": "巧了"}, {"start": 26.11, "end": 26.79, "text": "你杨野找你"}, {"start": 28.57, "end": 29.17, "text": "喂"}, {"start": 29.17, "end": 30.38, "text": "杨野"}, {"start": 30.38, "end": 31.26, "text": "江湖"}, {"start": 31.26, "end": 32.26, "text": "你胆子不小啊"}, {"start": 32.26, "end": 32.9, "text": "连我兄弟都敢跟他"}, {"start": 32.9, "end": 33.26, "text": "杨惹"}, {"start": 33.26, "end": 33.9, "text": "您听我解释"}, {"start": 33.9, "end": 35.3, "text": "我真不知道他是您兄弟"}, {"start": 35.3, "end": 36.18, "text": "不知道"}, {"start": 36.18, "end": 37.46, "text": "不知道就能随便欺负人"}, {"start": 37.46, "end": 38.18, "text": "是是是"}, {"start": 38.18, "end": 38.74, "text": "杨野"}, {"start": 38.74, "end": 39.7, "text": "您教训得对"}, {"start": 39.7, "end": 40.26, "text": "您放心"}, {"start": 40.26, "end": 41.1, "text": "我一定处理好"}, {"start": 41.1, "end": 41.38, "text": "一定"}, {"start": 41.38, "end": 42.06, "text": "我告诉你"}]}